From 11124ab7de1cfd3f0dcf20f19e064052953110d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <winshyon@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:35:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(attester): report contract rejections with a typed error
 code

examples/attest.ts decided whether a failed attestation should fail the
job by checking the error message for the word "cooldown". Control flow
riding on English wording breaks silently the moment a message is
reworded.

Export AttesterContractError, mirroring the attester contract's
enum Error, and carry the contract's numeric error as `contractError` on
the error AnchorAttester.attest returns when a simulation reverts.
explain() is exported and returns { code?, message }. The example now
compares against AttesterContractError.TooSoon. The error code and
message text are unchanged, so existing callers keep working.

Closes #239
